              x 2*(v jk.1 jk.2)^((3:ℝ)/2)+x 3*Real.sqrt (v jk.1 jk.2))‖^6) ≤
          C*(2:ℝ)^((ε+4)*n)/(10*R)^4*(6*(b-a)^4)⁻¹*
            (∑ j, ∫ x : Fin 4 → ℝ, ((1+‖(10*R)⁻¹ • x‖)^100)⁻¹*
              ‖∑ i ∈ S j, z j i*fordAdditiveCharacter
