            x 2*(w ji.1 ji.2)^((3:ℝ)/2)+x 3*Real.sqrt (w ji.1 ji.2))‖^6*
        ‖∑ jk ∈ Finset.univ.sigma V, c jk.1 jk.2*fordAdditiveCharacter
