        ‖∑ i∈V,c i*fordAdditiveCharacter ((n i:ℝ)*u+
          x 0*((n i:ℝ)/T)^2+x 1*((n i:ℝ)/T)^((3:ℝ)/2)+
          q*Real.sqrt ((n i:ℝ)/T))‖^6 := by
    simp only [bourgainSourceSixMoment,hev]
