        ‖∑ ji∈Finset.univ.sigma V,c ji.1 ji.2*fordAdditiveCharacter (phase (v ji.1 ji.2) x)‖^6)≤
        C*(2:ℝ)^(ε*n)/R^2*
          (∑ j,∫ x : Fin 4 → ℝ,((1+‖(320*R)⁻¹ • x‖)^100)⁻¹*
            ‖∑ i∈S j,z j i*fordAdditiveCharacter (phase (t j i) x)‖^6)*
