      h∈Ioc (0:ℝ) (1/100) → 0<T → T≤K → 0≤R →
      R*h^3≤32 → |q*h^3|≤32 → |q|≤R → 0<ν → ν≤|b-d| →
      T*h≤P → 2*R*h^2≤P →
      3/(100*P)≤(1/(2:ℝ)^n)^2 → P≤((2:ℝ)^n)^2 →
