perturbed cubic phase, with absolute convergence of the transformed series. -/
theorem bourgain_cubic_rational_weighted_poisson {χ : ℝ → ℂ}
    (hχ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ χ) (hs : HasCompactSupport χ)
    (μ : ℝ) (q : ℕ) [NeZero q] (a b : ℤ) :
